databaseCategory: "lore"
name: "Datachip: [accent]The arms race[]"
details: '''
[sky]Year: 176[] - [accent]The arms race[]
[grey](Eradication - Act: 2)

The events of exhaustion led rise to
many problematic factions

Born in the ruins
These factions were shaped into
ruthless ravengers

Not shying away from committing planet harming
atrocities as long it's necessary for there survival
  
This era saw a large increase
in ariel combat effectiveness and far more destructive
substances

This generation saw the creations of 
including the unit [accent]Volents[] and a new resource
called [accent]Combustive Biofuel[]

These designs would later be improved 
into the [accent]Zenith[] and [accent]Blast compound[] 
respectively

Most factions were taken out early in this arms race
all that remain of these factions were:
- Terra
- Mala
- Exogen
- Curiles
- Malis
- Crux

Later the arms race ended in the creation of the spores
Covering serpulo’s atmosphere and leading the planet into 
an age of eternal winter

Further dwindling the numbers in the remaining factions
Mainly factions whose main source of power was solar energy
'''

